{
 "id": "8bdd39dd-3f37-4bac-8aee-6a2339d42718",
 "page_id": "cc85e207-5bf6-4a3d-acdb-c94769296073",
 "language": "es",
 "title": "Acerca de Gabriel Mangabeira | Atleta Olímpico y Estratega de Growth Marketing",
 "meta_description": "De la piscina olímpica al crecimiento digital. Gabriel combina IA, Web3 y datos para crear sistemas de marketing medibles y escalables.",
 "content": "<article class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-8 md:py-12\">\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <header class=\"mb-12 text-center\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">Acerca de Mí</h1>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground\">De la disciplina olímpica a la estrategia de crecimiento Web3 — descubre cómo Gabriel Mangabeira combina IA, datos y storytelling para ayudar a las marcas a crecer con precisión y enfoque.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- From Olympic Lanes to Digital Growth -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">De los Carriles Olímpicos al Crecimiento Digital</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          Antes de construir un sistema de marketing, aprendí lo que realmente significa la consistencia — dentro de una piscina de 25 metros.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          Representar a <strong>Brasil en los Juegos Olímpicos</strong> me enseñó que los hábitos diarios más pequeños crean las victorias a largo plazo más grandes.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          Esa misma filosofía impulsa todo lo que hago hoy — ayudando a equipos y fundadores a crecer a través de sistemas que combinan <strong>disciplina, datos y creatividad</strong>.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          Desde <strong>exchanges Web3</strong> hasta <strong>marcas SaaS impulsadas por IA</strong>, he liderado estrategias que atraen millones de usuarios y convierten la visibilidad en crecimiento sostenible.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border\">\n        <img src=\"//images/gabriel-swimming-action.png\" alt=\"Gabriel Mangabeira compitiendo en los Juegos Olímpicos\" class=\"h-auto w-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- The Turning Point -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">El Punto de Inflexión</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">No cambié una arena por otra de la noche a la mañana.</p>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      Hubo un momento — entre entrenamientos y dashboards de campañas — donde me di cuenta de que el crecimiento, como el rendimiento, es predecible cuando lo tratas como un sistema.\n    </p>\n    <blockquote class=\"my-6 rounded-md border-l-4 border-primary bg-muted/40 p-6 italic\">\n      \"La natación me enseñó cómo superar límites; el marketing me enseñó cómo medirlos.\"\n    </blockquote>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      Fue entonces cuando comencé a diseñar frameworks para un crecimiento repetible y medible.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- My Journey -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Mi Trayectoria</h2>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 space-y-6\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2008</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Juegos Olímpicos</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">La consistencia supera la intensidad.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2015</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Neil Patel Brasil</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">SEO es estrategia, no atajos.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2019</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Binance LATAM</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">La escala amplifica claridad y caos — gestiona ambos.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2023</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Construyendo frameworks Web3</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">La libertad viene de sistemas que piensan por ti.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Behind the Frameworks -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Detrás de los Frameworks</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      No solo construyo embudos — construyo <strong>fundamentos</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      Cada sistema de cliente sigue un ritmo: → <strong>Observar</strong> → <strong>Experimentar</strong> → <strong>Medir</strong> → <strong>Escalar</strong>\n    </p>\n    <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold\">Valores Fundamentales</h3>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"/><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"/></svg>\n            Disciplina\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Mantén el carril, confía en el proceso.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><path d=\"M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z\"/><path d=\"M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2\"/><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"22\"/></svg>\n            Curiosidad\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Siempre cuestiona lo obvio.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"/><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"/></svg>\n            Consistencia\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Datos sobre drama.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>\n            Transparencia\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Crecimiento sin suposiciones.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- In My Own Words -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">En Mis Propias Palabras</h2>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\">\n      <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border\">\n        <img src=\"//images/gabriel-professional-about.png\" alt=\"Retrato profesional de Gabriel Mangabeira\" class=\"h-auto w-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n      <blockquote class=\"rounded-md border-l-4 border-primary bg-muted/40 p-6\">\n        <p class=\"italic\">El crecimiento no se trata de trabajar más duro; se trata de diseñar sistemas que hagan el trabajo duro por ti.</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 italic\">Cada campaña que construyo es comprobable, repetible y escalable — impulsada por IA, alimentada por datos e impulsada por la creatividad humana.</p>\n      </blockquote>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- What I'm Building -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Lo Que Estoy Construyendo</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Herramientas nacidas de resolver problemas reales:</p>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Web3 ROAST</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Auditorías CRO para proyectos crypto.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Token Health Scan</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Evaluación de riesgos para ecosistemas blockchain.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Growth Experiments Framework</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">El sistema operativo detrás de mi trabajo con clientes.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"mt-6 text-muted-foreground\">Cada uno comenzó como un experimento personal — ahora impulsan resultados para otros.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Beyond Work -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Más Allá del Trabajo</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Cuando no estoy construyendo sistemas de crecimiento, usualmente estoy:</p>\n    <ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\">\n      <li>🏊‍♂️ Buceando en apnea o nadando en aguas abiertas</li>\n      <li>✍️ Escribiendo frameworks en Medium</li>\n      <li>🤝 Mentoreando fundadores y creadores Web3</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Porque los sistemas no matan la creatividad — la sostienen.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Let's Collaborate -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <div class=\"rounded-lg border-2 border-primary bg-primary/5 p-6 text-center md:p-8\">\n      <h2 class=\"mt-0 text-2xl font-semibold\">Colaboremos</h2>\n      <blockquote class=\"my-4 text-lg italic text-muted-foreground\">¿Listo para convertir tu marketing en un sistema de crecimiento medible?</blockquote>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\">\n        <a href=\"/#how-i-help\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2\">Trabaja Conmigo</a>\n        <a href=\"https://calendly.com/gabriel-mangabeira/15min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2\">Agenda una Llamada</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Follow My Work -->\n  <section>\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Sigue Mi Trabajo</h2>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mangabeira/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        LinkedIn <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://medium.com/@gmangabeira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        Medium <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/gmangabeira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        GitHub <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabriel_Mangabeira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        Wikipedia <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</article>",
